<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Petrobras first half net lower.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Petrobras first half net lower.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-run oil firm Petrobras issued the following statement on its first half results.</p>
<p>			  H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>    Net		   252 million	  303 million</p>
<p>    Shr net	     2.32 reais	N/A</p>
<p>    Gross revs	  12.9 bln	  11.09 bln</p>
<p>    Net revs	     8.1 bln	   7.9 bln</p>
<p>    Net worth	   20.2 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
